weaknesses.issue:
1. The authors should add some figures to further explain how to integrate the proposed T-SGAN and SNN, and how the SNN works with the generated data;
2. The authors should discuss the biological plausibility of the proposed method;
3. In experiments, the authors should compare the proposed method with some more advanced GAN models to further validate the proposed method;
4. The authors should do some ablation experiments to validate the effectiveness of the proposed temporal dimension segmentation and spatial self-attention.
